        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVOSE</strong> is a <strong>cooperative horror game</strong> for up to 4 players. Your objective: investigate abandoned laboratories, identify a mutant creature, synthesize an antidote... and survive long enough to distribute it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here, nothing is handed to you. No HUD. No map. No respite. You'll have to figure out how everything works by <strong>exploring, deducing, and keeping your cool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent monster hunting</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster changes with each game. It has unique behaviors, mechanics, and weaknesses. Conduct a triple investigation: <strong>behavioral profile, abnormal abilities, and genetic signature.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player searches the databases? Another feeds the servers? A third searches for ingredients in the laboratories? Everyone has a vital role to play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One antidote, one chance</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has a unique weakness. Find the right ingredients, assemble them... before it's too late.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No heavy tutorial, no intrusive HUD</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment speaks for itself. Devose encourages you to think, observe, and communicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVOSE</strong> is a <strong>cooperative horror game</strong> for up to 4 players. Your objective: investigate abandoned laboratories, identify a mutant creature, synthesize an antidote... and survive long enough to distribute it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here, nothing is handed to you. No HUD. No map. No respite. You'll have to figure out how everything works by <strong>exploring, deducing, and keeping your cool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent monster hunting</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster changes with each game. It has unique behaviors, mechanics, and weaknesses. Conduct a triple investigation: <strong>behavioral profile, abnormal abilities, and genetic signature.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player searches the databases? Another feeds the servers? A third searches for ingredients in the laboratories? Everyone has a vital role to play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One antidote, one chance</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has a unique weakness. Find the right ingredients, assemble them... before it's too late.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No heavy tutorial, no intrusive HUD</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment speaks for itself. Devose encourages you to think, observe, and communicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "DEVOSE is a cooperative horror game for 1 to 4 players. Explore, find proofs and survive. Every corridor is a trap. Every noise can betray you. Coordinate or die alone.",
